# Both derived from the running application (scripts/dump_web_schema.py + npm run
# types). Committing them would create a second source of truth for the shapes the
# UI compiles against — and, worse, a de-facto snapshot gate on `/web`, which §8.9
# deliberately does not have: every UI field rename would then need a regenerated
# file in the diff, which is how a gate becomes a formality people click through.
# The frozen surface's snapshot is `openapi.json` at the repository root.
src/api/schema.json
src/api/schema.d.ts
